					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "&bWind and Water"
			x: -4.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7E2000000000000D"]
			description: [
				"&eConveyor Belts&r are IE's item transport, and they are deliberately not pipes - items ride on top where you can watch them, get picked up by hoppers, or be dropped into a furnace at the end of the line."
				""
				"They are slower than every other option in this pack and that is fine. Use them where the base is meant to look like a factory rather than a wall of hidden cables."
			]
			icon: "immersiveengineering:conveyor_basic"
			id: "7E2000000000000F"
			rewards: [{
				id: "7E20000000000112"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 40
			}]
			subtitle: "&7Items you can watch move"
			tasks: [{
				count: 16L
				id: "7E2000000000020F"
				item: "immersiveengineering:conveyor_basic"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "&bConveyor Belts"
			x: -2.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"7E2000000000000C"
				"7E2000000000000F"
			]
			description: [
				"Two industries, two personalities."
				""
				"&eThermal&r asks nothing of you - place a block, feed it power, walk away. It is the mod to reach for when you want a job done and don't want to think about it."
				""
				"&eImmersive Engineering&r asks for a build, and gives you a base that looks like somewhere work happens."
				""
				"Neither replaces Mekanism, EnderIO or Industrial Foregoing. All five accept each other's ores, dusts and power, so use whichever machine is nearest and stop worrying about picking a side."
			]
			icon: "immersiveengineering:blastbrick"
			id: "7E20000000000010"
			min_required_dependencies: 1
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "7E20000000000113"
					type: "xp_levels"
					xp_levels: 5
				}
				{
					id: "7E20000000000114"
					type: "random"
				}
			]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.5d
			subtitle: "&7Second industry established"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7E20000000000210"
				title: "Run a second industry"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "&b&lIndustrialised"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.75d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7E2000000000000A"]
			description: [
				"This is the single most important block in the chapter, and it looks like a greenhouse."
				""
				"The &eGarden Cloche&r grows a crop in a sealed box from water and power. &lNo farmland, no light level, no player standing nearby, no chunk babysitting.&r It just runs."
				""
				"&e&lPlant Industrial Hemp in it.&r Hemp is the feedstock for the entire fuel chain below, and one cloche produces it faster than a field would."
				""
				"&7In a void world this matters more than usual: you have no soil, no biomes and no rain. The cloche does not care about any of that."
			]
			icon: "immersiveengineering:cloche"
			id: "7E20000000000011"
			rewards: [{
				id: "7E20000000000511"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 50
			}]
			subtitle: "&7A farm with no farmland"
			tasks: [
				{
