			title: "&bThe Industrial Squeezer"
			x: -4.0d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7E20000000000011"]
			description: [
				"The &eIndustrial Fermenter&r ferments plant matter into &eEthanol&r - 80 mB per sugar cane."
				""
				"Second multiblock, same drill: craft, place, hammer. Sugar cane is trivially farmable and a cloche will grow that too, so this end of the chain costs you almost nothing once it is built."
				""
				"&7Plant oil and ethanol are the two halves of biodiesel. You need both running at once."
			]
			icon: "immersiveengineering:fermenter"
			id: "7E20000000000013"
			rewards: [{
				id: "7E20000000000513"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 50
			}]
			subtitle: "&7Sugar into ethanol"
			tasks: [
				{
