			y: 4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"7E20000000000012"
				"7E20000000000013"
			]
			description: [
				"The &eRefinery&r combines plant oil and ethanol into &eBiodiesel&r."
				""
				"&e&lThe ratio is the good part:&r 8 plant oil plus 8 ethanol gives 16 biodiesel. Nothing is lost. The whole cost of this chain is the four multiblocks and a hemp farm, and after that the fuel is genuinely free."
				""
				"&7Biodiesel is a real IE fluid with its own uses - the Diesel Generator burns it for serious FE. But in this pack it does something else as well."
			]
			icon: "immersiveengineering:refinery"
			id: "7E20000000000014"
			rewards: [{
				id: "7E20000000000514"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 60
			}]
			shape: "gear"
			subtitle: "&7Where the two halves meet"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "7E20000000000407"
					item: "immersiveengineering:refinery"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "7E20000000000408"
					item: "immersiveengineering:biodiesel_bucket"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "&bThe Refinery"
			x: -2.0d
			y: 3.8d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7E20000000000014"]
			description: [
				"&e&lThis pack counts Biodiesel as oil.&r"
				""
				"It is registered into the &e#ad_astra:oil&r fluid tag, which means you can pour it straight into the &eAd Astra Fuel Refinery&r and it refines 1:1 into rocket &eFuel&r at 30 FE/t."
				""
				"&6&lWhat that means:&r the space program stops running on coal. A hemp farm, four IE multiblocks and a cloche will fuel every rocket you ever build, forever, with no mining and no fuel cost at all."
				""
				"&7&lThe three oils, cheapest last:&r"
				"&7- &fBy hand&7 - 8 coal blocks plus a bucket. 72 coal per bucket. Your first rocket."
				"&7- &fCoal cracking&7 - a heated Create basin, 18 coal per bucket. 4x cheaper and automatable."
				"&7- &fBiodiesel&7 - this quest. No coal at all."
				""
				"&8All three go into the same Ad Astra Fuel Refinery. It is the only thing that makes Fuel, and it is a 1:1 conversion - oil supply was always the bottleneck, never the refining."
			]
			icon: "immersiveengineering:biodiesel_bucket"
			id: "7E20000000000015"
			rewards: [{
				id: "7E20000000000515"
				type: "xp_levels"
				xp_levels: 8
			}]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.5d
			subtitle: "&7Biodiesel IS rocket oil"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "7E20000000000409"
					item: "ad_astra:fuel_bucket"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "&6&lRockets Run on Hemp"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 3.8d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7E20000000000014"]
			description: [
				"The other thing to do with biodiesel: burn it."
				""
				"The &eDiesel Generator&r is a large multiblock that turns biodiesel into a lot of FE - far more than windmills will ever give you, and it runs day and night regardless of weather."
				""
				"&7Worth building once your hemp farm outproduces what the rockets need. It is the natural bridge between IE power and the electricity budget the rest of the pack wants."
			]
			icon: "immersiveengineering:diesel_generator"
			id: "7E20000000000016"
			rewards: [{
