			x: -2.0d
			y: 5.2d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7E20000000000014"]
			description: [
				"Four multiblocks producing four fluids need plumbing."
				""
				"&eFluid Pipes&r carry liquid and the &eFluid Pump&r pushes it. Unlike most mods' pipes these are directional and will happily pull from a multiblock output and shove it into the next machine's input."
				""
				"&7Insulate runs you care about, and remember the pump needs power. A &eFluid Router&r is worth building if one output has to feed two places."
			]
			icon: "immersiveengineering:fluid_pump"
			id: "7E20000000000017"
