		{
			dependencies: ["7E20000000000010"]
			description: [
				"LV wire caps out fast. &eMV Wire Coil&r (electrum) carries far more, and a &eTransformer&r steps between the two voltages."
				""
				"&c&lWire the transformer the right way round.&r The lower voltage goes on the small side, higher on the large. Backwards does nothing, and pushing HV into an LV connector destroys it in a small explosion."
				""
				"&7An &eMV Accumulator&r buffers the middle tier. From here the wires stop being decorative and start carrying your base."
			]
			icon: "immersiveengineering:transformer"
			id: "7E20000000000018"
