		{
			dependencies: ["7E20000000000018"]
			description: [
				"&eHV Wire Coil&r is steel, and it moves the kind of power the heavy multiblocks actually want - the Arc Furnace in particular will brown out anything smaller."
				""
				"The &eHV Accumulator&r is the big buffer. It is also, in this pack, a component of something much more important."
				""
				"&c&lHV wire is genuinely dangerous.&r Uninsulated HV will kill you if you walk into it. Insulate anything at head height or route it overhead."
			]
