			description: [
				"The &eEngineer's Circuit Table&r builds &eCircuit Backplanes&r into &eLogic Circuits&r and &eLogic Units&r."
				""
				"These are IE's answer to a processor - used in its own advanced machinery, and in this pack, in the last Sky Seal."
				""
				"&7Cheap to run once built. Keep a stack of logic units around; several things later want them."
