			description: [
				"&d&lThe ninth and final Sky Seal is built here.&r"
				""
				"&eSeal of Flux&r = &eHV Accumulator&r plus &eLogic Unit&r. High-voltage storage and a piece of logic - the most electrically advanced thing IE makes, standing in for mastery of power itself."
				""
				"&6The nine seals combine into the &eSky Matrix&r, and the Sky Matrix into the &eHeart of the Sky&r. That is the win condition of this pack, and this quest is one ninth of it."
				""
				"&7See the &fSky Seals&7 chapter for the other eight and what the Matrix needs."
