		{
			dependencies: ["7E20000000000019"]
			description: [
				"The &eAccumulator Backpack&r is a wearable battery that charges every powered tool you carry."
				""
				"Wear it and your drill, buzzsaw, revolver and railgun all top themselves up from it. It can be charged from a wire connector or, with the right upgrade, wirelessly from a Tesla Coil."
				""
				"&7Quietly one of the best quality-of-life items in the mod."
			]
			icon: "immersiveengineering:powerpack"
