		{
			dependencies: ["7E2000000000000C"]
			description: [
				"Most of IE's machinery is not craftable in a crafting grid. It is assembled on the &eEngineer's Workbench&r from an &eEngineer's Blueprint&r."
				""
				"Put the blueprint in the workbench, put the components in the slots below, and take the finished multiblock item out. Then place it and hit it with the hammer."
				""
				"&7Blueprints exist for components, molds, bullets, wiring and the specialist tools. This block is the gateway to the entire second half of the mod - build it before anything else on this row."
				""
				"&8An &eAutomated Engineer's Workbench&r does the same job from a conveyor feed once you want it hands-off."
			]
			icon: "immersiveengineering:workbench"
			id: "7E2000000000001E"
			rewards: [{
