		{
			dependencies: ["7E2000000000001E"]
			description: [
				"The &eMetal Press&r stamps ingots into &ePlates&r using swappable &eMolds&r."
				""
				"Plates are the tax on nearly every recipe in this mod and several others. Doing it by hand with the hammer works and gets old immediately."
				""
				"&e&lMolds worth having:&r Plate first, then Rod, Gear, Wire, and the Packing 3x3 and Unpacking pair - which turn nine ingots into a block and back with no crafting grid."
			]
