		{
			dependencies: ["7E2000000000001F"]
			description: [
				"The &eCrusher&r is a big multiblock that grinds ore into two dusts. Standard ore doubling, but it processes a stream rather than one item at a time."
				""
				"&7Feed it with conveyors and it will chew through everything your sieves produce without supervision."
				""
				"&c&lNote on the Excavator:&r IE's Excavator and Core Sample Drill find mineral veins in the world. &lThis is a void world - there are no chunks with veins in them&r, so neither is useful here. The Crusher plus your sieve output is the route in this pack."
			]
			icon: "immersiveengineering:crusher"
