		{
			dependencies: ["7E20000000000020"]
			description: [
				"The Arc Furnace eats &eGraphite Electrodes&r, and electrodes are made of &eHOP Graphite&r."
				""
				"&e&lThe chain:&r Coke Oven makes &eCoal Coke&r, the Crusher grinds it to &eCoke Dust&r, and the Arc Furnace or a kiln turns that into &eHOP Graphite Ingots&r. Three of those make an electrode."
				""
				"&c&lElectrodes wear out.&r Every Arc Furnace run consumes durability on all three, and replacing them is a permanent running cost. Automate coke dust early or the furnace will keep stopping."
			]
			icon: "immersiveengineering:ingot_hop_graphite"
