		{
			dependencies: ["7E20000000000021"]
			description: [
				"The &eArc Furnace&r is IE's endgame smelter. It makes steel far faster than the Improvised Blast Furnace, alloys most of the pack's metals, and - the part people miss - &erecycles tools and armour back into ingots&r."
				""
				"It is a large build, it wants HV power, and it needs graphite electrodes in place before it will run."
				""
				"&7Once this is up, the Improvised Blast Furnace becomes a bootstrap you never use again."
			]
			icon: "immersiveengineering:arc_furnace"
