			dependencies: ["7E2000000000000F"]
			description: [
				"The plain belt is one of eight. The variants are where conveyors stop being decorative:"
				""
				"&7- &fExtracting&7 - pulls items out of the inventory behind it"
				"&7- &fSplitting&7 - alternates output left and right, for free round-robin"
				"&7- &fDropping&7 - drops items off the end into a machine or a hopper"
				"&7- &fVertical&7 - carries items straight up a wall"
				"&7- &fCovered&7 - the same, but items cannot be picked up or shot off"
				"&7- &fRedstone Controlled&7 - stops when told to"
				""
				"&8Extracting plus Splitting is a complete two-machine feeder with no pipes, no filters and no power."
			]
